                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 71-year-old male admitted on 25/04/2017 with an acute exacerbation of known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, he presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray confirmed hyperinflation without consolidation. Arterial blood gas analysis revealed mild hypoxaemia with hypercapnia. Blood tests showed a mild inflammatory response. He was treated with nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, supplemental oxygen therapy, and received patient education regarding inhaler technique and self-management. He recovered satisfactorily and was discharged in stable condition. Please arrange follow-up spirometry and outpatient review within four weeks. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Hospital Physician]</div>
               </text>
